<title>USA: CUC Int'l to reorganize unit, cut 79 jobs.</title>
<headline>CUC Int'l to reorganize unit, cut 79 jobs.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>CUC International Inc on Wednesday said it will incorporate the travel operations of United Bank Services into current CUC units and create a CUC travel operation in the Norman, Oklahoma United Bank facility.</p>
<p>United Bank Services is a subsidiary of CUC's recently aquired Ideon Group unit.</p>
<p>CUC said about 79 United Bank positions will be cut, but noted that many of the affected employees will be allowed to apply for positions in the reorganized operation.</p>
<p>The move is expected to be completed by January 31, 1997.</p>
<p>All affected employees will be offered financial incentives to retain their current positions until January 31, 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
